    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-9d41615ec8d8cef559a502bc",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于线性定常（LTI）系统，BIBO稳定性等价于所有极点均严格位于左半平面（LHP）；虚轴上或右半平面（RHP）中的任何极点都会导致BIBO不稳定。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For LTI systems, BIBO stability is equivalent to all poles being strictly in the left half-plane (LHP); any pole on the imaginary axis or in the right half-plane (RHP) results in BIBO instability.",
